{"catch":"一場穿越美麗世界的寧靜之旅。","desc":"《夢幻健行》是一款輕鬆休閒的步行模擬遊戲，你將在一個美麗多彩的世界中探索，尋找隱藏的甜瓜。漫步於森林、山谷、山脈和神秘小徑，發現新的地點，欣賞世界的奇妙。\n\n無需匆忙，也無危險。只要穿上你的登山靴，欣賞沿途風景，睜大眼睛，盡情探索。\n\n你能找到多少個甜瓜呢？","publisher":"Downmeadowstreet","release":"2026-10-01","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/714741cc5e4e661488df287f21bdbf4f25fcd08e1fc373ac50fb9d08996b7aae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6504bbcd2fb67cf66bb0f16d78efa4bea0cf97a9a6217fa1eac89a210e3f90ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8a920f48dab2287f364b67d1eef3cdc20081cdfdf8b2e7c93423385815e0d8e2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/22728bb37cbd97bc988d112d3eab9a672768b928f7ad7dbfe6be025a71e38ebc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a88e97bd5b9c7f6fb979c592dd8f06d0b9348b88bad5c2ff3129dcc6d851f7a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/291732ef964a576ace2201caf04b5f7d9747c4d35fa98345d915b30fe9cc62d6.jpg"]}